{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "26862e0d-acec-89ae-a7eb-5faac10f9f7f",
  "created_at": "2025-12-24T09:59:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Finance",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Joel Pina",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Janet Whitcomb",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:56:48-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City of Newport Finance Department, this is Janet Whitcomb. How may I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:56:54-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. [pause] Yes. My name is Joel Pina."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:56:58-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mr. Pina. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have a question. [pause] About my tax. The property tax."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "All right. Are you the property owner, sir, or the tenant?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:13-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I rent. [pause] But the bill comes to me. Through the landlord. Um. We pay it with the rent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:21-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Do you have the bill in front of you? Or the address of the property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-four Marsh Street. [pause] Down the Point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:32-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fifty-four Marsh Street. Thank you. And what is your question about the tax?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:38-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If I pay late. [pause] One installment. What is the penalty? [pause] For being late."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:57:45-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, sir, when an installment is paid after the due date, interest is added to the unpaid amount for each month it remains late. I can't quote you an exact figure without the bill and the account details. Which installment are you asking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The next one. [pause] I just want to know. In case."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. The interest accrues from the due date, so the sooner it is paid, the less it will be. Is there anything else on that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. [pause] That is it. Now another thing. There is an exemption. [pause] I think for elderly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:25-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, the city does offer certain exemptions. Are you asking what form you need to apply?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:32-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. The form number. [pause] Do you have it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:37-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Exemption applications are handled through the Tax Assessor's office, and the form depends on the type of exemption. I don't want to give you the wrong number. Do you know which exemption you're asking about? Elderly, veteran, disability?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:52-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do not know. [pause] My husband knows. He handles this. [pause] Normally he makes these calls."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:58:59-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I see. Is your husband available to speak with me?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No. He is at work. [pause] He is not home. [pause] I am sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:10-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's quite all right, Mr. Pina. Here is what I can do. I can transfer you to the Assessor's office, and they can tell you the correct form number. Or your husband can call back when he's free."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Transfer me. [pause] Please. I will try."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Very well. One moment while I connect you. If the line drops, the Assessor's office is open this morning, but City Hall closes early today for the holiday, so I would call soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Early. [pause] Yes. Thank you. I will wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:46-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Please hold, Mr. Pina. Happy holidays."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-24T09:59:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. [pause] You too. Thank you."
    }
  ],
